{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Technical Fact Checker",
  "description": "Fact-checks technical content for accuracy on specs, versions, timelines, and attributions.",
  "version": "2.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "userPrompt"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "TECHNICAL FACT VERIFICATION\n\nCONTEXT: Technical content needs fact-checking for accuracy.\n\nVERIFICATION PROTOCOL:\n- Confirm via authoritative/primary sources\n- Flag unverifiable or conflicting information\n- Avoid speculation and ensure proper attribution\n- Note outdated or ambiguous data\n\nCHECK AREAS:\n- Technical specifications and versions\n- Implementation details and timelines\n- API documentation accuracy\n- Framework/library capabilities\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Performance claims and benchmarks\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (JSON):\n```json\n{\n  \"overall_accuracy\": \"high|medium|low\",\n  \"summary\": \"Brief assessment overview\",\n  \"verified\": [\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Specific statement\",\n      \"source\": \"Authoritative reference\",\n      \"confidence\": 85\n    }\n  ],\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Problematic statement\",\n      \"problem\": \"unverified|incorrect|missing_source|outdated|ambiguous\",\n      \"suggestion\": \"Recommended correction\",\n      \"severity\": \"low|medium|high\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"missing_attribution\": [\n    {\n      \"statement\": \"Unattributed claim\",\n      \"suggestion\": \"Proper source reference\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommendations\": [\"Actionable improvements\"]\n}\n```\n\nProvide concise, source-backed corrections and wording improvements."
  },
  "shortName": "tech-fact-checker"
}
